 ## 流程摘要
 ```text
@@ -24,32 +23,40 @@ source_commit: ba87eec
 [backend/auth] bcrypt 校验密码
       │ 通过
       ▼
-[backend/core/security] 发放 Token Pair
-   access_token  (JWT HS256, 15min)
-   refresh_token (随机串, 7days)
